11
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:46,360
So, having just heard from Kili and Syfy, I wonder if you envy the changes in their lives.

12
00:00:47,240 --> 00:00:51,240
It reminds me of this verse in the Bible, which says,

13
00:00:51,860 --> 00:00:55,560
It is God who arms me with strength and keeps my way secure.

14
00:00:55,560 --> 00:01:01,200
the god we know today is not just some abstract concept

